{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年41歲的前無綫（TVB）花旦楊秀惠於2019年與圈外富貴男友葉世揚結婚，翌年拍完《十八年後的終極告白》後約滿離巢並淡出演藝圈，專心打理美容生意</p><p>現年41歲的前無綫（TVB）花旦楊秀惠於2019年與圈外富貴男友葉世揚結婚，翌年拍完《十八年後的終極告白》後約滿離巢並淡出演藝圈，專心打理美容生意，創業短短幾年，生意額已經突破1億，她更開設線上課程學院「VY Academy」，分享自己創立網店、做生意的心得，成功轉型為商界女強人！楊秀惠日前上載片段，曝光近來難關接踵而來，曝光闊太亦生活不易！</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250727/1026199538630922240248706.jpeg/1HxToBlhoHXGBb2QCWen_TVJLrdwxEke5KrvEOSq7xA\" alt=\"楊秀惠大肚都好靚。（IG圖片）\"><figcaption>楊秀惠大肚都好靚。（IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210421/461499502848249856308425.jpeg/BDm8PORC6uMXWg_fAgZhHJCUWrnCgslRofK-fKHyvnw\" alt=\"楊秀惠有女萬事足。（IG：@vvyeo）\"><figcaption>楊秀惠有女萬事足。（IG：@vvyeo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210421/461499505037807616548193.jpeg/k51mQfSGxa6s0XbqFMEjRj-0_9VA8DJUEZ6W-hGelvo\" alt=\"楊秀惠有女萬事足。（IG：@vvyeo）\"><figcaption>楊秀惠有女萬事足。（IG：@vvyeo）</figcaption></figure><p>楊秀惠愛犬及外公輪流逝世</p><p>楊秀惠日前在Instagram分享片段，她透露最近憔悴了不少，臉上浮現黑眼圈，掩飾不住疲累。她透露較早前愛犬「飛雲」病逝，接着外公亦過身，她急急腳飛返新加坡處理後事，她坦言傷痛未退：「心裏面還在消化那種失去的感覺」。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250727/1026199535728332800485731.jpeg/zbgrGLyRtfSzT7b0YRdqdCJy3F6-ylx8tH2habR9oWk\" alt=\"楊秀惠坐私人遊艇出海。（IG圖片）\"><figcaption>楊秀惠坐私人遊艇出海。（IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250514/999330206923755520759816.jpeg/slNsrogZtOKCYYPaA08R2fAhR3-_fkiPPb9HCj2_Rwo\" alt=\"楊秀惠（網上圖片）\"><figcaption>楊秀惠（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250727/1026199533526192128352697.jpeg/UEl-VzndBS4fIk6MYlZJlmxvDRwUIQD9uRbSObkW0jk\" alt=\"楊秀惠揹名牌手袋自拍。（IG圖片）\"><figcaption>楊秀惠揹名牌手袋自拍。（IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>楊秀惠嘆心力交瘁</p><p>楊秀惠回到香港後，小朋友再輪流生病，令她心力交瘁，她說：「幾乎沒有好好睡過一晚。」楊秀惠嘆心理和身體都感到疲累：「照鏡子的時候，發現自己憔悴了很多，黑眼圈加深，眼角也好像跟着往下掉」。身心俱疲的她為自己做眼部護理，好好愛錫自己。不少人都留言稱讚她仍然靚女，着她好好保重。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260505/1128388722036314112649081.png/a_7RluR3qxpvVxkdPG3B0SsWWmd7FNwikqurLJKrqyw\" alt=\"楊秀惠透露早前愛犬逝世。（IG@vvyeo）\"><figcaption>楊秀惠透露早前愛犬逝世。（IG@vvyeo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260505/1128388719653818368089725.png/RRtDXRICO8-FPPJvtyrjI8f4vNK1yt59tPkSWLT5Elg\" alt=\"外公亦逝世。（IG@vvyeo）\"><figcaption>外公亦逝世。（IG@vvyeo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260505/1128388716860280832956802.png/nrniBW8kibb1CWh6dQAiydqo4kq31J5VKenyDynp8g8\" alt=\"小朋友輪流生病，楊秀惠坦言沒有好好睡過。（IG@vvyeo）\"><figcaption>小朋友輪流生病，楊秀惠坦言沒有好好睡過。（IG@vvyeo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260505/1128388714272264192109732.png/RWLre3YBe6nmrXMo4dAxdAXW8gsghSYktzgflrc4H5Y\" alt=\"楊秀惠嘆憔悴不少。（IG@vvyeo）\"><figcaption>楊秀惠嘆憔悴不少。（IG@vvyeo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260505/1128388712032374784140963.png/f9k0eb2l_FrYCvOdH9ywgm-GaD0E8FtM9b6YGPW-mBg\" alt=\"楊秀惠闊太生活都不容易。（IG@vvyeo）\"><figcaption>楊秀惠闊太生活都不容易。（IG@vvyeo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211031/531608357845471232594871.jpeg/oiMyVKStUNMOcW8D4SDGnBgOnl2mKFQ7jN_BnozfwZ4\" alt=\"陳茵媺與3子女及楊秀惠女兒一起到迪尼士樂園，大家都悉心打扮。（IG@aimeechan_official）\"><figcaption>陳茵媺與3子女及楊秀惠女兒一起到迪尼士樂園，大家都悉心打扮。（IG@aimeechan_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231212/811213118641803264925640.jpeg/DrR1Gw-Ws-G-dofbUsGzQm8CbwlboeH-a-m48mvpuPI\" alt=\"楊秀惠（IG@vvyeo）\"><figcaption>楊秀惠（IG@vvyeo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250204/963400272111996928638097.jpeg/JjvKRiYdPOL9GjAAQ9-F0dyyoe6RZxuEpNqtxqTarcY\" alt=\"楊秀惠第三度做媽媽﹗（IG：@vvyeo）\"><figcaption>楊秀惠第三度做媽媽﹗（IG：@vvyeo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231212/811213133494489088178953.jpeg/ir4ikLw9XGqiprty7vOatcHtotw2KUWOhZZmx4WWZsc\" alt=\"楊秀惠（IG@vvyeo）\"><figcaption>楊秀惠（IG@vvyeo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240112/822499105681969152123068.jpeg/5D9ecUOlGaRLV6iJHJpmtlJgtyERILMDLCeLHywnix8\" alt=\"不少女藝人都熱愛Rolex，楊秀惠所戴正是 Rolex鉑金冰藍面Daytona手錶（IG@vvyeo）\"><figcaption>不少女藝人都熱愛Rolex，楊秀惠所戴正是 Rolex鉑金冰藍面Daytona手錶（IG@vvyeo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250224/970734427741229056293481.jpeg/ZXnNvJubwJ-O2eN8Sv8PMo_MEO6wpja_C1zPlQtcz5U\" alt=\"楊秀惠生細仔後坐完月，仍似足少女。（IG@vvyeo）\"><figcaption>楊秀惠生細仔後坐完月，仍似足少女。（IG@vvyeo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250220/969383420134166528567182.jpeg/gXEge0MeDqx57AslfClBN7GcjuhldiwjmTWjS5k1o0s\" alt=\"楊秀惠好瘦！（網上圖片）\"><figcaption>楊秀惠好瘦！（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250224/970734425161601024186430.jpeg/e1KbYTXOYxJ6Y0WWaj6emPjX1kiQToOIkIhx1pCIcdY\" alt=\"楊秀惠生細仔後坐完月，仍似足少女。（IG@vvyeo）\"><figcaption>楊秀惠生細仔後坐完月，仍似足少女。（IG@vvyeo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250313/976988198536220672508193.jpeg/vXZ9ioHzd_lM1AkaacNFGdz-neOxgYNhqc9Pp6nPT6c\" alt=\"楊秀惠曬最愛手袋！（IG@vvyeo）\"><figcaption>楊秀惠曬最愛手袋！（IG@vvyeo）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-05T22:03:33.503887+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":976,"images":20,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}